msgid ""
"Click :download:`here <dl/CMUcam4GUI.zip>` to download the source code for "
"the CMUcam4GUI."
msgstr ""
"CMUcam4GUI의 소스 코드를 다운로드하려면 :download:`여기 <dl/CMUcam4GUI.zip>`\\ 를 클릭하십시오."

